      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样开口后，我向烈焰快驹低下了头。\n是为了向她道歉，为我至今的无礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9f1dafd4dde6758b21b70aecc1c2867ec11056ed0b35ad6e282cca564cee433",
