    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e418f2fa37fa0d51e5b5282",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是惊人的才能……！ 期待她未来的表现呢，刚才真是光芒四射！\n恭喜你！ 小姑娘，你长大以后一定会成为很厉害的赛马娘哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac0372b122b00ee8d59a06fbdba671a7b26e96b0658a07078111c24cf64b10bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
