      "uid": "zhcn:d4be2c0a36a6d0eb7d20fb81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是，为了能作为她真正的训练员并肩前行，\n所必须达成的、绝对要做到的事情。因此――",
      "source_fingerprint": "faca06f94dfca5dd1537c3347b30348e27572a9f42f0d404682c2de2cd7a7c09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
