      "uid": "zhcn:feb84afeaab47c541d239d75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果自己未能履行约定，能接手照顾她的\n后任训练员，我已经找好并谈妥了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62d1178c43a3bf3e74307ec86bd32898052498528450435169064d7d5eee2be4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
