      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "幸运的是，一位比我有成绩和经验的人愿意帮忙。\n在那位手下，她一定能得到稳妥的引导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72846f2d4716bc527d9e81d4ad2b50d84b5ed68d8a1cb4b38d96942e0879cd03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
